OL,3,AIran attacks US targets in Middle East
OL,4,Aafter four reportedly killed at wedding
OL,5,Acelebration
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes after the Iranian Red Crescent
OL,8,Fsaid four people - including a child -
OL,9,Fwere killed at a wedding celebration
OL,10,Fwhen shrapnel from a US missile hit a
OL,11,Fhouse in southern Iran. Iranian media
OL,12,Finitially said five people had been
OL,13,Fkilled
OL,15,FIn response, Mohammad Bagher Ghalibaf -
OL,16,FIran's chief negotiator in talks with
OL,17,Fthe US earlier this year - says: "If a
OL,18,Fpower acts like Satan, picks targets
OL,19,Flike Satan, and kills like Satan, it's
OL,20,FSatan"
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
