OL,3,AIran attacks US targets in Middle East
OL,4,Aafter four reportedly killed at wedding
OL,5,Acelebration
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US military says it is aware of the
OL,8,Freports but that it never targets
OL,9,Fcivilians, and was striking Iranian
OL,10,Ftargets in response to "recent
OL,11,Fattempted attacks" on American forces
OL,12,Fand commercial shipping in the Strait
OL,13,Fof Hormuz
